Package: devjam-gpu-brave-config
Version: 1.5-6
Section: web
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: brave-flags-wrapper
Suggests: brave-origin | brave-browser
Maintainer: Bob Rosbag <debian@bobrosbag.nl>
Description: GPU acceleration flags for Brave
 Default command line flags for brave-browser, read through
 brave-flags-wrapper, that enable VA-API video decoding and encoding,
 GPU compositing and rasterization, and the Vulkan/ANGLE backend.
